+9. Previews are sent to the customer and all file paths are recorded in Neon.
+10. When Portmone merchant credentials are configured, the bot creates a checkout for this menu. Its callback checks the provider's order, merchant, amount and paid status before sending the full PDF and recipe sheet. The print PDF goes to the print shop only if SMTP is configured.
+
+## Personal wallpaper
+
+Choose «Створити шпалери-маніфестацію» in the bot, then send five photographs in order: your portrait and four scenes. Send five goals, one per line, then press «Втілити в реальність». The image editor receives all five photographs; the bot draws the exact phrases supplied by the user on a 1080 × 1920 PNG and sends a preview and the complete PNG as a Telegram document. No goals are built into the script. The artwork quality depends on the image editor and supplied photographs.
+
+Wallpaper checkout is not connected to Portmone. The full PNG is currently delivered without a payment requirement. Menu and wallpaper use separate checkout paths.
+
+## Payments and print dispatch
+
+Set `PORTMONE_PAYEE_ID`, `PORTMONE_LOGIN`, `PORTMONE_PASSWORD`, `MENU_PRICE` and `CURRENCY=UAH` in `.env` to enable menu payments. When these values are missing or the provider cannot create an invoice, the bot sends the menu preview without an active pay button. The order keeps its price snapshot in the database for later verification. The legacy Redsys link was removed because it had no signed gateway integration.
+
+Set `PRINTSHOP_EMAIL`, `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_PORT`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASSWORD`, `SMTP_USE_TLS` for real print dispatch. Empty SMTP settings disable dispatch; they never report a simulated success. Run `alembic upgrade head` before starting the updated bot.
+
+The recipient email and separate shopping-list delivery are not collected in the current bot. The paid order's recipe PDF, including the shopping list, goes to the menu buyer in Telegram. The in-process task queue and wallpaper input state are not durable across process restarts; use a persistent queue/FSM store before scaling or promising uninterrupted orders.
+
+If an image or recipe cannot be generated, the menu is marked failed and no payment link is sent. The bot no longer sells a booklet with made-up recipe placeholders.
 
